{% comment %}
================================================================================
BW Browse Products Webhook
================================================================================
PURPOSE: Fires on "Product Viewed" custom event. Updates seven user attributes:
  - recently_browsed_products    — rolling window of 8 unique products
  - browse_affinity_categories        — unique categories in the window, most-viewed first
  - browse_top_category               — single most-viewed category
  - browse_affinity_categories_count  — number of unique categories (for canvas branching)
  - browse_affinity_collections       — BW collections in the window, most-viewed first
  - browse_top_collection             — single most-viewed collection
  - browse_affinity_collections_count — number of unique collections (for canvas branching)

CANVAS: "BW - Track Browse Products" — immediate re-entry, single Webhook step.

CANVAS ENTRY PROPERTIES (from Product Viewed event, under data.p):
  canvas_entry_properties.${product_id}   — Shopify product ID (dedup key)
  canvas_entry_properties.${name}         — "Nomad Sofa Sectional"
  canvas_entry_properties.${image_url}    — CDN image URL
  canvas_entry_properties.${url}          — product URL (contains tracking params)
  canvas_entry_properties.${category}     — "Sectional Sofas"

URL CLEANING: Keep only query params whose key starts with an uppercase letter.
  Preserves Burrow product selectors (Fabric, Leg%2BFinish, Arm%2BStyle, etc.)
  and drops all tracking params regardless of source — utm_*, gclid, fbclid,
  msclkid, ttclid, lid, userid, bzt, em, fn, ln, etc.

COLLECTION DETECTION: Checked against product_title using contains.
  Known collections: Nomad, Range, Russet, Shift, Field, Span, Union, Ember, Mambo, Index, Title.
  First match wins. Re-detected from item.product_title on each webhook fire —
  not stored on the product object. Empty string if no collection matches.

DEDUP LOGIC: By product_id. If the product was viewed before (even a different
  variant of the same product), the old entry is removed and the new one
  appended as the most recent.

DROP LOGIC: When the array is at 8 items and the product is not a duplicate,
  the oldest item (forloop.first = index 0) is dropped to make room.

ARRAY ORDER: Oldest at index 0, newest at the end. The email grid reads with
  | reverse | slice: 0, 8 to show newest first.

AFFINITY SORT: Outer loop checks counts from 8 down to 1, emitting items with
  exactly that count in first-seen order (for stable tie-breaking).

BRAZE WEBHOOK CONFIG:
  Method: POST
  URL:    https://rest.iad-06.braze.com/users/track  ← verify cluster for BW workspace
  Headers:
    Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BW_REST_API_KEY
    Content-Type: application/json
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign max_items = 8 %}
{% assign collections_list = 'Nomad,Range,Russet,Shift,Field,Span,Union,Ember,Mambo,Index,Title' | split: ',' %}

{% comment %} ── Current product fields ──────────────────────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign product_id    = canvas_entry_properties.${product_id} | default: '' %}
{% assign product_title = canvas_entry_properties.${name}       | default: '' %}
{% assign image_url     = canvas_entry_properties.${image_url}  | default: '' %}
{% assign raw_url       = canvas_entry_properties.${url}        | default: '' %}
{% assign category      = canvas_entry_properties.${category}   | default: '' %}
{% assign now_iso       = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}

{% comment %} ── Abort: no product_id (can't dedup without it) ───────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% if product_id == blank %}
  {% abort_message('no product_id in event') %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
URL CLEANING — keep only params whose key starts with an uppercase letter.
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{% endcomment %}
{% assign url_parts    = raw_url | split: '?' %}
{% assign url_base     = url_parts[0] %}
{% assign url_query    = url_parts[1] | default: '' %}
{% assign clean_params = '' %}
{% if url_query != '' %}
  {% assign raw_params = url_query | split: '&' %}
  {% for param in raw_params %}
    {% assign param_key   = param | split: '=' | first %}
    {% assign first_char  = param_key | slice: 0, 1 %}
    {% assign first_upper = first_char | upcase %}
    {% if first_char == first_upper and first_char != '' %}
      {% if clean_params == '' %}
        {% assign clean_params = param %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign clean_params = clean_params | append: '&' | append: param %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if clean_params != '' %}
  {% assign clean_url = url_base | append: '?' | append: clean_params %}
{% else %}
  {% assign clean_url = url_base %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ── Detect collection from incoming product title ─────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign product_collection = '' %}
{% for coll in collections_list %}
  {% if product_collection == '' %}
    {% if product_title contains coll %}
      {% assign product_collection = coll %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %} ── Load existing array; check for duplicate product_id ──────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign existing_products = custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products} | default: empty %}
{% assign duplicate_found = false %}
{% for item in existing_products %}
  {% if item.product_id == product_id %}{% assign duplicate_found = true %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %}
================================================================================
  PRE-COMPUTE: Build category + collection lists for the final window.
  Mirrors the JSON body loop exactly so the affinity arrays reflect the precise
  window that will be written to recently_browsed_products.
  Collection is detected from item.product_title each time (not stored on the
  object) using the same contains-check against the known collections list.
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_cats_line  = '' %}
{% assign ba_colls_line = '' %}

{% for item in existing_products %}
  {% unless item.product_id == product_id %}
    {% unless existing_products.size >= max_items and duplicate_found == false and forloop.first %}

      {% comment %} Category {% endcomment %}
      {% assign item_cat = item.category | default: '' %}
      {% if ba_cats_line == '' %}
        {% assign ba_cats_line = item_cat %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign ba_cats_line = ba_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: item_cat %}
      {% endif %}

      {% comment %} Collection: detect from product_title each time {% endcomment %}
      {% assign item_coll = '' %}
      {% for coll in collections_list %}
        {% if item_coll == '' %}
          {% if item.product_title contains coll %}
            {% assign item_coll = coll %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      {% unless item_coll == blank %}
        {% if ba_colls_line == '' %}
          {% assign ba_colls_line = item_coll %}
        {% else %}
          {% assign ba_colls_line = ba_colls_line | append: '|||' | append: item_coll %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endunless %}

    {% endunless %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %} Add incoming product's category {% endcomment %}
{% if ba_cats_line == '' %}
  {% assign ba_cats_line = category %}
{% else %}
  {% assign ba_cats_line = ba_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: category %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} Add incoming product's collection (only if detected) {% endcomment %}
{% unless product_collection == blank %}
  {% if ba_colls_line == '' %}
    {% assign ba_colls_line = product_collection %}
  {% else %}
    {% assign ba_colls_line = ba_colls_line | append: '|||' | append: product_collection %}
  {% endif %}
{% endunless %}

{% assign ba_cats_arr  = ba_cats_line  | split: '|||' %}
{% assign ba_colls_arr = ba_colls_line | split: '|||' %}

{% comment %} ── Unique categories (first-seen order for tie-breaking) ──────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_seen_cats = '::' %}
{% assign ba_unique_cats_line = '' %}
{% for cat in ba_cats_arr %}
  {% unless cat == blank %}
    {% assign cat_check = '::' | append: cat | append: '::' %}
    {% unless ba_seen_cats contains cat_check %}
      {% assign ba_seen_cats = ba_seen_cats | append: cat | append: '::' %}
      {% if ba_unique_cats_line == '' %}
        {% assign ba_unique_cats_line = cat %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign ba_unique_cats_line = ba_unique_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: cat %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign ba_unique_cats_arr = ba_unique_cats_line | split: '|||' %}

{% comment %} ── Unique collections (first-seen order for tie-breaking) ─────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_seen_colls = '::' %}
{% assign ba_unique_colls_line = '' %}
{% for coll in ba_colls_arr %}
  {% unless coll == blank %}
    {% assign coll_check = '::' | append: coll | append: '::' %}
    {% unless ba_seen_colls contains coll_check %}
      {% assign ba_seen_colls = ba_seen_colls | append: coll | append: '::' %}
      {% if ba_unique_colls_line == '' %}
        {% assign ba_unique_colls_line = coll %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign ba_unique_colls_line = ba_unique_colls_line | append: '|||' | append: coll %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign ba_unique_colls_arr = ba_unique_colls_line | split: '|||' %}

{% assign ba_cats_count  = ba_unique_cats_arr.size %}
{% assign ba_colls_count = ba_unique_colls_arr.size %}

{% comment %}
  Sort unique categories by count descending.
  Outer loop iterates target 1..8 → check_count 8..1 so highest counts emit first.
  Ties preserve first-seen order (insertion order of unique cats).
{% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = '' %}
{% assign ba_sorted_cats_seen = '::' %}
{% for target in (1..8) %}
  {% assign check_count = 9 | minus: target %}
  {% for ucat in ba_unique_cats_arr %}
    {% unless ucat == blank %}
      {% assign already_in = '::' | append: ucat | append: '::' %}
      {% unless ba_sorted_cats_seen contains already_in %}
        {% assign this_count = 0 %}
        {% for c in ba_cats_arr %}
          {% if c == ucat %}{% assign this_count = this_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% if this_count == check_count %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_cats_seen = ba_sorted_cats_seen | append: ucat | append: '::' %}
          {% assign cat_clean = ucat | replace: '"','' | strip %}
          {% if ba_sorted_cats_json != '' %}{% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = ba_sorted_cats_json | append: ',' %}{% endif %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = ba_sorted_cats_json | append: '"' | append: cat_clean | append: '"' %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %}
  Sort unique collections by count descending. Same strategy.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_sorted_colls_json = '' %}
{% assign ba_sorted_colls_seen = '::' %}
{% for target in (1..8) %}
  {% assign check_count = 9 | minus: target %}
  {% for ucoll in ba_unique_colls_arr %}
    {% unless ucoll == blank %}
      {% assign already_in = '::' | append: ucoll | append: '::' %}
      {% unless ba_sorted_colls_seen contains already_in %}
        {% assign this_count = 0 %}
        {% for c in ba_colls_arr %}
          {% if c == ucoll %}{% assign this_count = this_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% if this_count == check_count %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_colls_seen = ba_sorted_colls_seen | append: ucoll | append: '::' %}
          {% assign coll_clean = ucoll | replace: '"','' | strip %}
          {% if ba_sorted_colls_json != '' %}{% assign ba_sorted_colls_json = ba_sorted_colls_json | append: ',' %}{% endif %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_colls_json = ba_sorted_colls_json | append: '"' | append: coll_clean | append: '"' %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %} ── Extract top-ranked category and collection ─────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_top_cat  = ba_sorted_cats_json  | split: '","' | first | remove: '"' %}
{% assign ba_top_coll = ba_sorted_colls_json | split: '","' | first | remove: '"' %}

{
  "attributes": [
    {
      "braze_id": "{{ braze_id | replace: '"','' }}",
      "recently_browsed_products": [
        {%- assign printed = false -%}
        {%- for item in existing_products -%}

          {%- unless item.product_id == product_id -%}
            {%- unless existing_products.size >= max_items and duplicate_found == false and forloop.first -%}

              {%- if printed -%},{%- endif -%}
              {
                "product_id":     "{{ item.product_id    | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "product_title":  "{{ item.product_title | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "image_url":      "{{ item.image_url     | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "url":            "{{ item.url           | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "category":       "{{ item.category      | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "last_viewed_at": "{{ item.last_viewed_at | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}"
              }
              {%- assign printed = true -%}

            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endunless -%}

        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- if printed -%},{%- endif -%}
        {
          "product_id":     "{{ product_id         | replace: '"','' }}",
          "product_title":  "{{ product_title      | replace: '"','' }}",
          "image_url":      "{{ image_url          | replace: '"','' }}",
          "url":            "{{ clean_url          | replace: '"','' }}",
          "category":       "{{ category  | replace: '"','' }}",
          "last_viewed_at": "{{ now_iso }}"
        }
      ],
      "browse_affinity_categories":       [{{ ba_sorted_cats_json }}],
      "browse_top_category":              "{{ ba_top_cat  | replace: '"','' }}",
      "browse_affinity_categories_count": {{ ba_cats_count }},
      "browse_affinity_collections":      [{{ ba_sorted_colls_json }}],
      "browse_top_collection":            "{{ ba_top_coll | replace: '"','' }}",
      "browse_affinity_collections_count": {{ ba_colls_count }}
    }
  ]
}
